  IconPath: icons/skills/ranged/target-bullseye-archer-orange.webp
  Description: Masterful Hunter Upgrade Level 17 Your weapon mastery allows you to
    hit your prey's vital areas multiple times. The second time in a round you hit
    your hunted prey, you also deal 1d8 precision damage. At 19th level, your second
    hit in a round against your hunted prey deals 2d8 precision damage, and your
    third hit in a round against your hunted prey deals 1d8 precision damage.
